  "method": "Decode full audio to floating-point PCM at its native sample rate and explicitly average stereo channels (no default equal-power downmix gain); measure RMS and exact-frequency amplitude using a Hann-windowed complex projection. Decode actual display-oriented RGB pixels. Inspect every video frame PTS; require monotonic timestamps, no faster than bounded30fps, no gap over120ms, and both PCM/video tails within120ms of the requested timeline. Still movies must have expected30fps frame count within2; slowed-video scenes retain their legitimate15fps cadence.",
